{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThe 56 audited developer-tooling paths under `scripts/` contain confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. Five path-disjoint leaves own the edits; this story owns only their completion inventory.\n\n## Plan\n- Complete the five leaves without changing their Scope or file-impact manifests.\n- Each leaf edits only allowlisted prose, preserves behavior-bearing text, runs its recorded checks, and obtains the required non-author semantic-review TSV.\n- At story completion, read the live children of `restless-contagious-cougar`, follow each net-active `replacement -supersedes-> retired source` link, and compare the retired source file impact with the replacement Scope and file impact.\n- Write a sorted 56-row TSV to a dedicated `session_log` linked `relates_to` this story. Each row is `path<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>source-ticket-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count`.\n- In the completion comment, cite that log and record the TSV row count and SHA-256.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct repository edits: none.\n- Children: 5 grouped leaves.\n- Audited boundary: 56 paths under `scripts/` reached through the leaves' net-active `supersedes` links.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The story inventory contains exactly 56 rows.\n- [ ] The inventory contains exactly 56 distinct audited paths.\n- [ ] The inventory contains exactly 56 distinct retired source tickets.\n- [ ] Every retired source ticket has exactly one live replacement leaf.\n- [ ] Every inventory row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every inventory row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] The expected, replacement-Scope, and replacement-file-impact path sets are equal.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every migrated consumer contract has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a non-author `bloat-removal=PASS` row.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] The story session log records each leaf commit, command result, and reviewer-log id.\n- [ ] The completion comment cites the story session-log id.\n- [ ] The completion comment records inventory row count 56.\n- [ ] The completion comment records the inventory SHA-256.\n\n## Completion boundary\nThe story closes only after all five children are closed and the inventory checks above pass."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788666829490620001,"uuid":"b21972cd-4418-4f7f-b14a-5f80dc63fce3"}